{"words": [{"text": "وَلَقَدْ", "translation": "And surely"}, {"text": "كُذِّبَتْ", "translation": "were rejected"}, {"text": "رُسُلٌۭ", "translation": "Messengers"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلِكَ", "translation": "before you"}, {"text": "فَصَبَرُوا۟", "translation": "but they were patient"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "over"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "كُذِّبُوا۟", "translation": "they were rejected"}, {"text": "وَأُوذُوا۟", "translation": "and they were harmed"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰٓ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "أَتَىٰهُمْ", "translation": "came to them"}, {"text": "نَصْرُنَا ۚ", "translation": "Our help"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And no"}, {"text": "مُبَدِّلَ", "translation": "one (can) alter"}, {"text": "لِكَلِمَـٰتِ", "translation": "(the) words"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۚ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَلَقَدْ", "translation": "and surely"}, {"text": "جَآءَكَ", "translation": "has come to you"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "نَّبَإِى۟", "translation": "(the) news"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ", "translation": "(of) the Messengers"}], "sahih": "And certainly were messengers denied before you, but they were patient over the denial, and they were harmed until Our victory came to them. And none can alter the words [i.e., decrees] of Allāh. And there has certainly come to you some information about the [previous] messengers."}